&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Lua/Luau and building on Roblox&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for contributing to the Roblox development community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excitement for building both Lua/Luau-based libraries, foundational layers, and user interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No serious or recent moderations incidents and are at least 18-years old&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
