&lt;p&gt;· &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;Develop&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;software&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;tools&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;scripts&lt;/em&gt; for various &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;software&lt;/em&gt; and hardware &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;integration&lt;/em&gt; &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;tests&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;· Debug the hardware and &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;software&lt;/em&gt; time critical issues utilizing debugging &lt;em class=&quot;Highlight ht66007af3-ee7d-439a-b08a-1869df455896&quot; style=&quot;font-style: inherit;&quot;&gt;tools&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
