&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Colorado, Hawaii, Illinois, Maryland, Massachusetts, Minnesota, Vermont or Washington D.C. : $32.00/hour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in New York, New Jersey, Washington State, or California (outside of the San Francisco Bay area): $34.00/hour&lt;/li&gt;
